%  Relevant files

InitCondFile        tests/TemperatureStep/conduction_1b_wendlandc6.ic

% CPU-time limit %%%%%%%%%%%%%% TimeLimitCPU*0.6=BetRest

TimeLimitCPU      1728000
CpuTimeBetRestartFile  900

% Code options

ComovingIntegrationOn 0

NumFilesPerSnapshot       1
NumFilesWrittenInParallel 1


%  Caracteristics of run

MaxMemSize          1200
TimeBegin           0.0
TimeMax             0.005

Omega0                0
OmegaLambda           0

OmegaBaryon           0
HubbleParam           0.7   ; only needed for cooling

BoxSize                1.0
PeriodicBoundariesOn   1


% Output frequency

OutputListFilename  outputs_selection.txt
OutputListOn        0


TimeBetSnapshot        0.0005
TimeOfFirstSnapshot    0

MaxSizeTimestep        0.005

%  Parameters of SPH


ArtBulkViscConst    2.0


% Further code parameters

PartAllocFactor       3.0
BufferSize              20

% System of units

UnitLength_in_cm         1.0
UnitMass_in_g            1.0
UnitVelocity_in_cm_per_s 1.0


% Softening lengths

SofteningGas       0.000051  % 0.4
SofteningHalo      2.0
SofteningDisk      0.4
SofteningBulge     0.4
SofteningStars     0.4
SofteningBndry     0.4

SofteningGasMaxPhys       0.000051  %0.4
SofteningHaloMaxPhys      2.0
SofteningDiskMaxPhys      0.4
SofteningBulgeMaxPhys     0.0
SofteningStarsMaxPhys     0.4
SofteningBndryMaxPhys     0.4


% conduction @todo

ConductionEfficiency 1.0
MaxSizeConductionStep 2.5E-4
